              <span>Validate templates before deployment</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="mr-2">•</span>
              <span>Store complex templates in files</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="mr-2">•</span>
              <span>Use macros for reusable components</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="mr-2">•</span>
              <span>Keep templates simple and readable</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="lg">
